131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (During my time at Ohio State University, I noticed the significant preparedness disparity among students, especially those from Black and Latinx backgrounds, in their pursuit of internships and new graduate positions. In 2022, I found ColorStack, a transformative solution offering resume reviews, career advice, and hidden opportunities. ColorStack became my compass to success, prompting me to share it with peers. Collaborating with Jehron, I established a thriving ColorStack chapter in 2023, now with over 100 members. Like a reliable oasis, ColorStack empowers underrepresented students to navigate career challenges confidently, providing unwavering support and an environment to embrace their identities and aspirations. )
/E (During my time at Ohio State University, I noticed the significant preparedness disparity among students, especially those from Black and Latinx backgrounds, in their pursuit of internships and new graduate positions. In 2022, I found ColorStack, a transformative solution offering resume reviews, career advice, and hidden opportunities. ColorStack became my compass to success, prompting me to share it with peers. Collaborating with Jehron, I established a thriving ColorStack chapter in 2023, now with over 100 members. Like a reliable oasis, ColorStack empowers underrepresented students to navigate career challenges confidently, providing unwavering support and an environment to embrace their identities and aspirations. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
